{"unit_id":"hanxuanliang__dsh-chaos#feature-channels","repo":"hanxuanliang/dsh-chaos","commit":"d439bf9f47e2436c408e896ebb7fbad025faf791","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chaos 的功能「频道与消息」：成员可在频道或私信中发送协作消息，并查看目标中的消息历史。Agent 可调用 message_send 写入消息、调用 message_read 读取消息或历史页。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:317","src/tools.ts:369"]}
{"unit_id":"hanxuanliang__dsh-chaos#feature-threads","repo":"hanxuanliang/dsh-chaos","commit":"d439bf9f47e2436c408e896ebb7fbad025faf791","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chaos 的功能「消息线程」：用户或 Agent 可围绕根消息创建或定位线程，并在其中继续讨论；Agent 工具支持通过根消息 ID 或短引用读取线程内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:317"]}
{"unit_id":"hanxuanliang__dsh-chaos#feature-tasks","repo":"hanxuanliang/dsh-chaos","commit":"d439bf9f47e2436c408e896ebb7fbad025faf791","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chaos 的功能「任务跟踪」：可将顶层消息创建为任务、认领或释放任务，并更新待办、进行中、审核中和完成状态。Agent 工具提供创建、认领、列表及状态操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:423","src/tools.ts:444","src/tools.ts:464"]}
{"unit_id":"hanxuanliang__dsh-chaos#feature-agents","repo":"hanxuanliang/dsh-chaos","commit":"d439bf9f47e2436c408e896ebb7fbad025faf791","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-chaos 的功能「Agent 管理」：设置页提供 Agent 管理界面，可配置名称、提供商、模型和预设；每个 Agent 关联稳定资料和工作区，并能替换运行会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/entry/index.tsx:14","src/runtime.ts:83"]}
